-- the needed-parameter set to its fixed point: a round only adds pairs, one per parameter at most,
-- so a round that adds nothing is the fixed point and the parameters' count plus one rounds reach it
-- (2026-11-12: a fixed 64 rounds erased to 0 a parameter not yet found needed)
x-rel-len : Rel → Word
x-rel-len lnil = #0
x-rel-len (lcons p r) = wadd #1 (x-rel-len r)
